      "id": 1,
      "text": "Chandler Park was named for Zachariah Chandler, Detroit\u2019s most famous abolitionist and a leading 19th\u2011century politician.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
